  "UPDATED": "2026-10-03",
  "DESCRIPTION": "Shared base rule (every owner). Normalized scam links (lowercase host, no www, no http/https, no trailing slash, tracking query parameters removed; t.me/telegram.me paths lowercased and a leading @ removed; api.whatsapp.com/send?phone=N -> wa.me/N). An exact Telegram/WhatsApp link match is enough to auto-block; any other watchlisted link auto-blocks together with an existing lure or impersonation feature. An entry without a path matches the whole domain. Entries: domain, url, kind, source, first_seen_handle, added.",
  "NEVER_WATCHLIST_DOMAINS": [
    "x.com",
    "twitter.com",
    "tesla.com",
    "spacex.com",
    "x.ai",
    "neuralink.com",
    "boringcompany.com",
    "starlink.com",
    "terafab.ai"
  ],
